<title>USA: FERC okays Delmarva, Atlantic merger.</title>
<headline>FERC okays Delmarva, Atlantic merger.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Federal Energy Regulatory Commission on Wednesday approved the proposed merger of Delmarva Power &amp; Light Co and Atlantic Energy Inc.</p>
<p>The two utilities plan to form a company called Conectiv Inc to sell energy products and services in Maryland, Delaware, New Jersey and Pennsylvania, and sell energy in Virginia.</p>
<p>The merger still needs state agency approvals, which the utilities expect to receive by the end of this year.</p>
</text>
